# Real power-curve library (renewables.ninja / VWF / thewindpower.net): kept
# local-only and never redistributed. The repo ships the open turbine curve
# library (NatLabRockies/turbine-models, BSD-3) at input/reference/power_curves.csv
# and input/reference/models.csv instead. See input/README.md.
input/reference/power_curves.real.csv
input/reference/models.real.csv
/input
/output
/out
/overleaf

# Internal research-log docs kept local-only (research dates, "next steps"
# language not appropriate for the public-facing docs/ folder). Paths updated
# after the docs/ reorganisation moved these under findings/.
docs/TRAINING_2015_2021_SUMMARY.md
docs/TURBINE_GRID_EVALUATION_ANALYSIS.md
docs/findings/TRAINING_2015_2021_SUMMARY.md
docs/findings/TURBINE_GRID_EVALUATION_ANALYSIS.md

# Local working notes for AI coding sessions (CLAUDE.md): records the real local
# environment, standing caveats, and what must never be committed. Deliberately
# not shipped -- CONTRIBUTING.md is the public contributor guide.
/CLAUDE.md

# Commercial / career material never belongs in this public repo. The working
# copies live outside the repository entirely (../../Career/); these patterns are
# a safety net in case anything is ever dropped in here by mistake.
Career/
career/
docs/career/
docs/commercial/
docs/notes/
**/PASSIVE_INCOME.md
**/BUSINESS_SETUP.md
**/NEXT_STEPS.md
**/FACTS.md

